The work is not notifiable. **Schedule 4 para 1(h)** covers replacing an external door where the door and frame together are not more than 50% glazed on their internal face. A solid back door with glazing under 50% falls within that exemption.

The **Schedule 3 para 10** competent-person route for replacement windows and doors therefore does not apply. The small residual probability on it allows for a borderline glazing measurement.

